human_context:
  who: Developers who need to show an AI agent, an MCP server or a person as a business card a human can read — tools, registries and pages that already have the facts and want one clean view of them.
  what: "Render a business card for an AI agent, an MCP server or a person, and print it to screen as one self-contained HTML page: front and back, flip, light/dark, landscape/portrait."
  why: Agent cards (A2A Agent Card, MCP Server Card, .fafa) are written for machines. People need the same facts as a business card they can look at, flip and share. This prints one from whichever reader supplies the facts, and guesses nothing — no colour declared means ink.
  where: https://github.com/Wolfe-Jam/agent-business-card
  when: "2026-10-10"
  how: npm run build
